---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /editor/templates/
published: false
gate: true
title: Templates
overline: Private · Studio only
subtitle: Two ways to write. Field guide keeps a contents rail on the left. Essay is one column. Change the theme in the header and the callouts, code, and type follow.
seo:
  title: Templates — Studio
  description: Private previews of the field guide and the essay.
---

<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-overline">{{ overline }}</div>
  <h1 class="hero-title">{{ title }}</h1>
  <p class="hero-lede">{{ subtitle }}</p>
  <p><a href="/editor/">← Back to the studio</a></p>
</div>

<div class="tpl-grid" data-gated>
  {% for t in templates %}
  <a class="tpl-card" href="/editor/templates/{{ t.id }}/">
    <div class="wire wire--{{ t.id }}" aria-hidden="true">
      <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
    </div>
    <div class="tpl-card__body">
      <div class="tpl-card__kicker">
        <span>{{ t.id }}</span>
        {% if t.advanced %}<span>Advanced</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
      <h2 class="tpl-card__title">{{ t.title }}</h2>
      <p class="tpl-card__when">{{ t.when }}</p>
      <p class="tpl-card__cmd">npm run new -- {{ t.id }} "Title"</p>
    </div>
  </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-label">The contract</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">What you actually edit</h2>
  <div class="callout">
    <div class="callout__label">Front matter, then markdown</div>
    <p>Only <code>layout</code> and <code>title</code> are required. New files start as <code>published: false</code>. Publish when the post should appear on the home page. Field guide keeps the left rail. Essay does not. Change the theme in the header and callouts, code, and cards follow.</p>
  </div>
</section>
